00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

1
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,920
Your sister's off to the capital.

2
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,200
It's not like Tongzhou.

3
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,039
So you take good care of her, all right?

4
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,320
Don't worry, Grandma.

5
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,680
You're very kind, Mother.

6
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,520
I'm humbled.

7
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,240
I know life isn't easy for you.

8
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,039
Just

9
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,560
take care of yourself.

10
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,360
That's the greatest gift

11
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,960
you could ever give me.

12
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:07,080
I've heard what you've been through

13
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,280
these past few months in the capital.

14
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:11,560
You're a smart girl.

15
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,520
But remember this.

16
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,920
No matter how hard things get

17
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,960
from now on,

18
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,920
don't ever carry it all alone.

19
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:21,480
You just let me know.

20
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,480
I will, Grandmother.

21
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,600
Mother.

22
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,120
That Mrs. Ji is finally gone.

23
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,000
Yesterday,

24
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000
all I wanted was a little piece of that pinkish gauze

25
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:44,920
for a trim.

26
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,760
The mistress hadn't even said a word,

27
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,400
and she gave me a dirty look instead.

28
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,840
She starts going on about how cold it is

29
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,600
and why would anyone use gauze.

30
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,760
Then she says I don't know the value of anything.

31
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,120
Pfft!

32
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,720
An outsider,

33
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:57,480
coming into our Gu manor

34
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,440
and telling everyone what to do.

35
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,000
Unbelievable.

36
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,800
Mother,

37
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,200
please don't cross Mrs. Ji.

38
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,280
She's even tougher than the mistress.

39
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,960
And honestly, the fabric thing is secondary.

40
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,120
My coming-of-age ceremony next year

41
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,080
is what really matters.

42
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,840
Have you asked the mistress

43
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,000
how much silver the palace will give?

44
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:16,880
Well.

45
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,400
My lady asked.

46
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,600
The mistress says by the rules,

47
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,360
the palace can only give two hundred taels.

48
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,880
She'll add another hundred

49
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,120
from her private purse.

50
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,880
So my lady thought

51
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,440
we add seven hundred ourselves,

52
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,640
and make it a thousand.

53
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:32,320
We can't do that.

54
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:33,680
You worked so hard

55
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,720
to save that money.

56
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,040
We can't just throw it away.

57
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,520
Besides,

58
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,360
that would only

59
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,800
be a thousand taels.

60
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:41,079
But I heard that

61
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:41,880
for my eldest sister's coming-of-age ceremony,

62
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,800
they spent over ten thousand.

63
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,840
Lan,

64
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,079
her coming-of-age ceremony

65
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,440
was all paid for

66
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,800
by the Ji family.

67
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,880
We didn't spend a single tael.

68
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:57,280
Just because my mother's family isn't powerful,

69
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:59,000
I'm supposed to keep my head down.

70
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,480
I'm a concubine's daughter as it is.

71
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,600
If my coming-of-age ceremony

72
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,680
is too shabby,

73
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,640
people will only look down on me even more.

74
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,440
And when it's time to find a match,

75
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,960
what kind of good family would want me?

76
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,000
But honestly, my mother's family isn't bad at all.

77
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,000
A fourth-rank official in the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

78
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,320
Even if he's retired,

79
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,040
that's still way better than the Ji family,

80
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,120
who are just merchants.

81
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,560
I don't understand what my mother was thinking.

82
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:20,959
Just for the sake of Father,

83
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,640
she abandoned her own parents

84
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,400
and married him as a secondary wife.

85
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,400
Miss.

86
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,280
Here's a letter from our young lord.

87
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,880
Could you give it to Miss Gu?

88
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:33,640
Thank you.

89
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,080
Sure.

90
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,080
Changshun.

91
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,840
Second Miss.

92
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,320
That man just now

93
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,920
was from the Marquis of Changxing's residence, wasn't he?

94
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,720
Miss Ziling, sharp eyes.

95
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,200
Yes, he's from there.

96
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,040
He came

97
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,600
to deliver an invitation to the eldest Miss.

98
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,040
Just as well.

99
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,800
I'm heading to the main house

100
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,760
to find her for dinner.

101
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,160
I'll give it to her for you.

102
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,480
There's only you at the gate.

103
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,600
You can't leave your post.

104
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,720
Fair enough.

105
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,400
Thank you very much, Second Miss.

106
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,200
[Thank you for saving me outside Baoxiang Temple.]

107
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,720
[Tomorrow between 9 and 11 AM,

108
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,800
I will host a banquet at Linxia.]

109
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,200
[I await your arrival.]

110
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,520
[I knew it.]

111
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,600
[There's something between the young lord and my eldest sister.]

112
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,040
This one seems thicker.

113
00:05:50,159 --> 00:05:51,480
Yeah, and the color is nicer too.

114
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,080
Madam.

115
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,880
You wanted to see me?

116
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,240
Yes, come sit down.

117
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,880
I made a few pairs of

118
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,080
knee pads,

119
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,720
all stuffed with goose down.

120
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,640
This pair is for Yao.

121
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:08,600
And

122
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,960
this one is for Rong.

123
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,840
He's almost back,

124
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:12,800
isn't he?

125
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,080
And this pair

126
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,840
is for your father.

127
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,800
I've already prepared a calligraphy scroll

128
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,360
for Rong

129
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,320
as a welcoming gift.

130
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,760
You don't need to go out of your way

131
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,240
to prepare anything in my name.

132
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,840
As for Father,

133
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,160
if you want to give him something, just do it.

134
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,920
You don't have to say it's from me.

135
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:35,840
I understand how you feel.

136
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,400
But

137
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,280
Rong is your own brother.

138
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,040
You didn't grow up together,

139
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,440
so it's easy to be distant.

140
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:45,760
Antiques and calligraphy

141
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,120
are nice,

142
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,120
but they're also

143
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,560
a bit cold.

144
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,920
Something made by hand

145
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,080
carries more heart.

146
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,200
Right?

147
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,640
As for your father,

148
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,240
he may have his faults,

149
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:01,040
but he's your own flesh and blood.

150
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,880
If word gets out that you've been cold toward him,

151
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,760
people will only blame you.

152
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,000
And besides,

153
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,920
Your marriage can't wait any longer.

154
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,760
He is an official,

155
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,040
and knows a lot of people.

156
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,800
If he would just help a little,

157
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,000
finding a good match would be much easier.

158
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,880
[Marriage talk again.]

159
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:20,920
[And the mistress still thinks

160
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,160
he can be counted on.]

161
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,360
Yao has just started at Cunshan Academy.

162
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,840
I wonder how he's doing.

163
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,480
Since the knee pads are already made,

164
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:29,640
I should send them to him

165
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,920
as soon as possible.

166
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,440
Maybe I'll go to the academy

167
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:33,560
tomorrow.

168
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:34,960
Sounds good.

169
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,800
This crossbow is nicely done.

170
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:48,120
Give him ten taels.

171
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,720
Yes, sir.

172
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,240
Thank you, my lord.

173
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,120
If you can extend the range

174
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,680
another fifty paces,

175
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,800
I'll give you a hundred.

176
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,560
I'll get right on it, my lord.

177
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:08,800
My lord,

178
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:11,200
we're supposed to meet Miss Gu at nine.

179
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,320
Shouldn't we go?

180
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,400
What's the rush?

181
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,080
Let her wait.

182
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,080
Yes, my lord.

183
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,280
Fine.

184
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,480
Look at you, so impatient.

185
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,480
Let's go.

186
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,640
It's already an hour past the time.

187
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,440
Why isn't she here yet?

188
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,240
Maybe

189
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,520
she got held up on the way.

190
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,840
It's not far anyway.

191
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,240
Send someone

192
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,560
to the Gu household to meet her.

193
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:48,640
Yes, sir.

194
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:07,920
Miss.

195
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,520
I told Luo Gui'er not to wait.

196
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,840
He should find a place out of the wind

197
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:11,880
and come back in an hour

198
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,840
to pick you up.

199
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,320
Our young lady is Miss Gu.

200
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:22,720
She's here to see Mr. Chen Xuanqing.

201
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,240
Would you mind letting him know, sir?

202
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,160
Please follow me inside.

203
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,520
My lord.

204
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:42,720
What happened?

205
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:43,800
Where's Gu Jinzhao?

206
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,120
Miss Gu,

207
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,360
she went to the academy.

208
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,280
The academy again.

209
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,480
Top Scholar.

210
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,840
A Miss Gu is outside

211
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,560
asking for you.

212
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,760
Miss Gu?

213
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:06,840
The one

214
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,320
who was here with Ms. Ji last time.

215
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,760
Are you sure she wants to see him?

216
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,560
Not me?

217
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,520
She didn't mention you, sir.

218
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,160
Got it.

219
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,880
The other day, your grandmother and Miss Gu

220
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:26,720
came to my house.

221
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,800
I lent her a book.

222
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,440
She's probably here to return it.

223
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,800
But I just remembered

224
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,360
the lecturer needs to see me.

225
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,720
He told me to wait for him.

226
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,120
I really can't leave.

227
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,400
So

228
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,080
maybe you could help me out?

229
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,160
Go see Miss Gu

230
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,680
and get the book back for me.

231
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:44,520
Would you?

232
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,840
I can't go to her.

233
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,520
You know my cousin's temper.

234
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,360
Since she didn't ask for me,

235
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,280
if I showed up,

236
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,840
she'd be furious.

237
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,360
So here's what we do.

238
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,480
Send someone else

239
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,520
to see her.

240
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,000
Tell her you got held up

241
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,280
by the lecturer

242
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,640
and can't come.

243
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,160
Then have her give the book

244
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:07,360
to that person

245
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,080
to bring back.

246
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:08,840
What do you think?

247
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,520
Sounds good.

248
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,080
Miss.

249
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:38,880
Miss Gu.

250
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,600
Mr. Zhang.

251
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,160
Long time no see

252
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,600
since the Chen house.

253
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:46,560
Anyway,

254
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,000
Xuruo got called away by the lecturer,

255
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:49,360
won't be back for a while.

256
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,560
He said

257
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,240
you have a book for him.

258
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,160
You can just hand it to me.

259
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,440
So he sent you to pick it up?

260
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:58,240
That's right.

261
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:02,960
One moment, please.

262
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,120
Much obliged.

263
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,160
My pleasure.

264
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,240
Well, well. A touching scene of young love.

265
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:38,040
I thought you were so busy.

266
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,520
Turns out you're here meeting some other man.

267
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,920
Greetings, my lord.

268
00:12:42,160 --> 00:12:43,120
I think you've misunderstood.

269
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,400
I was just...

270
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,440
Are you following me?

271
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,120
Don't

272
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,120
flatter yourself.

273
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,000
I just happened

274
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,320
to pass by

275
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,280
and saw you here,

276
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,280
messing around with a man.

277
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:59,440
That's all.

278
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,840
So this is the one you've set your sights on?

279
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,200
Nonsense.

280
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,360
Are you cured now

281
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,920
and looking for a fight again?

282
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,240
You saved me once,

283
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:11,680
and now you think you can walk all over me.

284
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:12,840
Don't forget,

285
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:13,960
if it weren't for my help,

286
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:14,600
you'd already be a married woman

287
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,520
in the Liu family.

288
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,680
So that's why

289
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:17,720
you didn't want to marry into the Lius.

290
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,080
You went through all that trouble begging for my help.

291
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:22,080
I thought you had high standards.

292
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,120
But after all that,

293
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,600
this is the kind of man you're after.

294
00:13:26,920 --> 00:13:27,960
No matter how bad your reputation is,

295
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:28,720
you don't just settle for

296
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,800
the first thing that comes along.

297
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,560
Who I choose

298
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,080
has nothing to do with you, my lord.

299
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:34,280
But

300
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:36,160
you are the Crown Prince's companion.

301
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,880
Shouldn't you be with His Highness?

302
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,320
Why do you spend your days following me instead?

303
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:41,000
If you're well enough,

304
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,720
go back to your duties at the palace.

305
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,480
If you're still unwell

306
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:46,240
then go home and rest. Leave me alone.

307
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,880
What's the matter?

308
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:49,960
Upset that I caught you in the act?

309
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:50,920
Boring.

310
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:52,920
I have things to do. I'll take my leave.

311
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,720
What are you doing?

312
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,360
Trying to leave, are you?

313
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,120
Li Xianhuai.

314
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,240
Now,

315
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,400
go look into this man.

316
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,040
I want to see

317
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,560
what kind of brilliant scholar

318
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,560
has caught

319
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,600
our Miss Gu's eye.

320
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:14,520
Yes.

321
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:15,720
Wait.

322
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,720
My lord, you've misunderstood.

323
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,480
There's nothing between Miss Gu and me.

324
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,400
Miss Gu,

325
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,600
please

326
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:23,320
explain to the young lord.

327
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,800
Please.

328
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,240
My lord.

329
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:29,120
Mr. Zhang

330
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,680
has done nothing to you.

331
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,080
Why are you investigating him?

332
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,240
I'll look into whoever I want.

333
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,160
What's it to you?

334
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:35,000
Li Xianhuai.

335
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,440
Yes.

336
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:36,240
Wait.

337
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,480
If you have a problem,

338
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,680
take it out on me.

339
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,160
Don't bully Mr. Zhang.

340
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,760
He just passed

341
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,080
the provincial exam,

342
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,920
and

343
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,000
he can't withstand your scrutiny.

344
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,480
If people find out

345
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,120
he's offended you,

346
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:51,040
they'll

347
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:51,880
trample him.

348
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:53,040
How will

349
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,800
he ever take the imperial exams

350
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:57,240
or become an official?

351
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,760
You're worried about his future.

352
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:04,680
I remember now.

353
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:07,040
I've seen you

354
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:07,560
at Chen Yanyun's place.

355
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:08,560
Yes, yes.

356
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,600
I had the honor of meeting you, my lord.

357
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,120
Let me ask you something.

358
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:14,560
If you gave up the imperial exams

359
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,720
and became a staff officer in our marquisate,

360
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:18,880
would you be willing?

361
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,160
Don't push it too far.

362
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,600
My lord, are you serious?

363
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,560
What if I am?

364
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:29,840
Mr. Zhang,

365
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:31,000
what are you doing?

366
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,000
Don't tell me

367
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,520
you're giving up the spring exams?

368
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,400
Miss Gu.

369
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,680
To be honest, passing the provincial exam

370
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,400
was pure luck.

371
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,640
It's all thanks to my ancestors.

372
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,440
I know my own limits.

373
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,960
I have no strength left

374
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,120
for the exam path.

375
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,440
Even if I sat

376
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,640
for the spring exams,

377
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,200
I'd get nowhere.

378
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:50,880
A fifth rank post

379
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,160
in the marquisate.

380
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:54,040
Why wouldn't I be willing?

381
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:55,160
Well,

382
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:58,840
if I could serve you, my lord,

383
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:01,120
I would gladly give up the spring exams

384
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:03,240
and follow your command.

385
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:13,120
What a shame.

386
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,240
I was just joking.

387
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,280
Why are you taking it so seriously?

388
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,040
You.

389
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,040
How could you do this?

390
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,760
How else could I

391
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,280
show you that

392
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:31,040
people don't always act the way you expect?

393
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:33,160
You said if I investigated him,

394
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,480
I'd ruin his exams

395
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:35,320
and career.

396
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:36,280
But

397
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,520
this man doesn't even have the confidence

398
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:38,240
to sit for the spring exams.

399
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,640
I dangled a little bait

400
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:42,320
and he jumped at it.

401
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:43,920
With that kind of character,

402
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,360
even if he became an official,

403
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,480
he'd just be a useless seat warmer.

404
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:48,960
Come to think of it,

405
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,320
I just happened

406
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,680
to uncover a mediocre talent

407
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,440
for the court.

408
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,520
How wonderful.

409
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,400
You.

410
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:57,520
You.

411
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,240
Oh no!

412
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:09,240
What is it?

413
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:09,920
What happened?

414
00:17:10,079 --> 00:17:11,560
Mr. Zhang got into a fight

415
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,839
and coughed up blood.

416
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,480
He's been taken to a clinic.

417
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:16,640
What?

418
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:21,839
Why are you staring at me?

419
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,720
How was I supposed to know he's that fragile?

420
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:24,880
You're not blaming me for this,

421
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,839
are you?

422
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,839
Who would dare blame you, my lord?

423
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:29,160
You're

424
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,640
from a noble house.

425
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,120
Raised in privilege your whole life.

426
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,720
Of course you wouldn't understand.

427
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,280
A casual promise from you

428
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,440
is a chance most people couldn't earn

429
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,720
in several lifetimes.

430
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:39,200
And

431
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,120
a casual retraction from you

432
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:42,360
is enough

433
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,360
to make a man cough up blood.

434
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:44,440
Maybe

435
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,720
even kill him.

436
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,760
What are you talking about?

437
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,480
In fact,

438
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:50,600
people your age

439
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:52,160
are either working the fields,

440
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,400
studying by candlelight,

441
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,800
or fighting at the front.

442
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:56,200
Working their fingers to the bone

443
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,040
to feed their families.

444
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,080
But you?

445
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:00,600
You eat, drink, and entertain yourself all day.

446
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:01,560
Lazy and wandering.

447
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:02,960
Living off your ancestors' glory.

448
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,040
Producing nothing.

449
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,920
You contribute nothing to the country or its people.

450
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:06,800
How dare you speak to me like that!

451
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:15,200
Miss.

452
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:15,880
Jinzhao.

453
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:16,760
- Stop it.
- Jinzhao.

454
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:17,280
Miss.

455
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:24,920
This academy is a place of sages.

456
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:25,880
How dare you act so recklessly,

457
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,760
my lord?

458
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,320
You dare hurt our young lady?

459
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,080
- Insolent!
- Qingpu.

460
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:33,880
Ms. Chen.

461
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:35,000
Second Brother.

462
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,400
Let him go.

463
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,360
He's just a madman.

464
00:18:39,040 --> 00:18:40,640
It's not worth going against him.

465
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,240
Enough.

466
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,920
Let's take care of your injury first.

467
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:01,640
Split it fifty-fifty.

468
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,760
So by my math,

469
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:06,520
we only need

470
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:07,240
another hundred and fifty taels.

471
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:09,600
Or

472
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:11,080
let's make it an even two hundred.

473
00:20:11,760 --> 00:20:12,920
But here's the thing.

474
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:15,240
You and your sister didn't grow up together.

475
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,160
Might feel a bit distant.

476
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,200
Distance isn't a problem.

477
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:20,560
The more distant,

478
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,200
the more expensive the meeting gift has to be.

479
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:23,400
Why else would I spend five taels

480
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,000
on that jade bracelet?

481
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:26,600
It's for the eldest sister.

482
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:29,400
It's called fishing, get it?

483
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:31,800
She'll have to give something back.

484
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,680
Gold, jade,

485
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,640
antiques or calligraphy,

486
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:35,800
as long as it's worth more than two hundred taels,

487
00:20:36,120 --> 00:20:36,960
I win.

488
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,080
The eldest miss is loaded.

489
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:41,480
Maybe

490
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,840
she could even take care of that little matter

491
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:43,760
for us without breaking a sweat.

492
00:20:43,760 --> 00:20:44,240
Shut up.

493
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:45,320
Yes, sir.

494
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:47,120
I'm an idiot.

495
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:48,080
- That matter.
- I'm an idiot.

496
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,200
Not a word of it must ever get out.

497
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:50,400
You hear me?

498
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:52,360
Understood.

499
00:20:52,760 --> 00:20:53,720
I promise I won't say a thing.

500
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:54,960
I promise.

501
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,320
Not a word

502
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:03,320
about what happened today.

503
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,360
Yes, miss.

504
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:07,680
Miss,

505
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:09,000
hurry to the main house.

506
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,120
Young Master Rong has returned.

507
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,040
Wasn't he not coming

508
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,920
until the end of the month?

509
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:16,880
Go tell the mistress

510
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:18,640
I'll be there as soon as I change my clothes.

511
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:19,400
Yes, miss.

512
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:25,320
Mother.

513
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:29,240
How did you get so thin?

514
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,440
Your cheeks are sunken in.

515
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,080
Have you been studying too hard?

516
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:35,800
The eldest miss and the second miss are here.

517
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:38,440
I'll have to fatten you up.

518
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:44,360
Rong.

519
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,080
Greetings,

520
00:21:46,520 --> 00:21:47,440
big sister.

521
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:50,000
You've grown so tall.

522
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:51,560
Quite the handsome young man.

523
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:52,840
Big sister, you're beautiful too.

524
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,040
Like someone out of a painting.

525
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:56,760
Second sister.

526
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,800
You're back.

527
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:01,600
Everyone, please sit.

528
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:07,120
Weren't you coming back at the end of the month?

529
00:22:07,280 --> 00:22:08,400
Why the early return?

530
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:09,600
That was the plan,

531
00:22:09,840 --> 00:22:10,720
but the teacher suddenly came down

532
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:11,800
with a bad cough,

533
00:22:11,920 --> 00:22:12,920
so he let us out early.

534
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:14,600
I wrote about it

535
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:15,760
in my letter to second sister.

536
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:17,040
Didn't she tell you?

537
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:19,680
I thought

538
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:21,040
you wrote to Mother as well.

539
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,080
So

540
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:23,720
you only wrote to me.

541
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,240
It's my fault,

542
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:27,840
big sister.

543
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:29,480
should have told you.

544
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:31,080
No harm done.

545
00:22:31,360 --> 00:22:32,680
Either way,

546
00:22:32,680 --> 00:22:34,240
Huaiyuan is all ready for you.

547
00:22:35,880 --> 00:22:36,840
Did you bring gifts

548
00:22:36,840 --> 00:22:38,680
for your sisters?

549
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:39,280
Yes.

550
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:39,920
Shuangli.

551
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,480
Big sister.

552
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,080
This one is for you.

553
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,120
That's thoughtful of you.

554
00:22:53,120 --> 00:22:53,840
I just picked it at random.

555
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:55,240
The luster looked good,

556
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,080
but I wasn't sure

557
00:22:56,080 --> 00:22:57,320
if it would suit you.

558
00:23:01,160 --> 00:23:01,880
It's perfect.

559
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:02,920
Thank you.

560
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:04,120
I'm glad.

561
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:10,360
What a beautiful ivory concentric ball.

562
00:23:11,120 --> 00:23:12,840
You actually carved it?

563
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,360
Did you carve this

564
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:17,640
yourself?

565
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:18,360
Yes.

566
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:20,080
Mother, look.

567
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:22,960
- Let me see.
- It wasn't that hard.

568
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,120
No,

569
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:25,520
but what matters is the thought behind it.

570
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:26,440
That's worth

571
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:27,760
more than any gold or jade.

572
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:29,480
Last time,

573
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:30,960
I mentioned

574
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:33,000
I wanted an ivory concentric ball.

575
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,240
He said he'd make me one.

576
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,240
I never thought

577
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,480
he'd actually pull it off.

578
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:38,240
Who would have guessed

579
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:39,480
you had such skill?

580
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:42,160
I made another one.

581
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:43,480
This one is for you.

582
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:45,000
But it's not finished yet.

583
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:45,800
Once it's done,

584
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:46,840
I'll bring it to you.

585
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,440
I have a gift for you too.

586
00:23:50,960 --> 00:23:51,600
Qingpu.

587
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,200
Go on, open it.

588
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:07,920
What is it?

589
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:14,520
It's a pair of knee pads.

590
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:15,960
It's getting cold.

591
00:24:16,200 --> 00:24:17,640
You can wear them when you write.

592
00:24:18,280 --> 00:24:19,520
Your sister is so thoughtful.

593
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:21,200
She made these

594
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:22,640
herself.

595
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:27,400
It's not gold or jade.

596
00:24:28,080 --> 00:24:29,000
Just a little something from the heart.

597
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:39,200
Miss,

598
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,680
didn't you already give him a pair of knee pads?

599
00:24:41,360 --> 00:24:42,960
Why add this painting?

600
00:24:46,080 --> 00:24:47,440
You saw it yourself.

601
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:48,840
The moment he saw those knee pads,

602
00:24:49,040 --> 00:24:50,400
his smile froze.

603
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:52,440
Clearly, he didn't like them.

604
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:55,080
So

605
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:56,440
I might as well

606
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,240
give him this rooster fighting painting.

607
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,520
It was meant for him anyway.

608
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:02,000
Miss, you're so good to Mr. Ji.

609
00:25:03,280 --> 00:25:04,800
But from what I can see,

610
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:05,960
he seems closer

611
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:08,000
to the second young lady.

612
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,400
They grew up together.

613
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,280
Of course

614
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:13,480
he's closer to her than to me.

615
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:21,520
You actually carved a concentric ball

616
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,880
for the eldest sister?

617
00:25:23,280 --> 00:25:24,520
As if I have that much free time.

618
00:25:24,760 --> 00:25:26,000
I just said it in passing.

619
00:25:26,320 --> 00:25:27,120
It's all your fault.

620
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:28,120
Why did you have to show off

621
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:29,480
in front of her?

622
00:25:29,880 --> 00:25:31,080
I wasn't showing off.

623
00:25:31,760 --> 00:25:33,320
I was just happy

624
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:34,520
and said too much.

625
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,560
Anyway, she didn't say anything.

626
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:39,040
Yeah.

627
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:40,200
But all she gave me

628
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,040
was a lousy pair of knee pads.

629
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:44,760
So,

630
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:46,400
you've been sucking up to her

631
00:25:46,560 --> 00:25:47,520
because

632
00:25:47,520 --> 00:25:48,880
you're hoping for something expensive in return.

633
00:25:49,520 --> 00:25:50,720
Isn't that fair?

634
00:25:51,080 --> 00:25:52,120
I went to all that trouble

635
00:25:52,120 --> 00:25:53,160
picking out that bracelet for her.

636
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:54,800
And

637
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:55,520
she fobs me off

638
00:25:55,520 --> 00:25:56,520
with cheap knee pads.

639
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:00,520
Look at you, counting every penny.

640
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,000
Well,

641
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:04,840
let me ask you something.

642
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,160
Do you have any spare money

643
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:08,240
lately?

644
00:26:08,560 --> 00:26:09,280
No.

645
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:11,800
You haven't even heard how much.

646
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:13,800
I don't have any.

647
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,760
I only get two taels a month.

648
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,400
Barely enough for face powder and hair oil.

649
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:19,280
What do you need the money for?

650
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,040
I.

651
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:23,160
Nothing.

652
00:26:23,160 --> 00:26:23,920
I have my reasons.

653
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:25,080
What reasons?

654
00:26:26,120 --> 00:26:27,200
Well, since you don't have any to lend,

655
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:27,960
don't ask.

656
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,080
Miss,

657
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:39,160
why is Ms. Ji so short of money?

658
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:41,040
He even borrowed from the second young lady.

659
00:26:42,040 --> 00:26:44,080
He's still studying,

660
00:26:44,600 --> 00:26:45,640
no drinking,

661
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:47,080
no parties.

662
00:26:47,560 --> 00:26:48,200
He shouldn't

663
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:49,480
need that much.

664
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:52,280
Anyway,

665
00:26:52,760 --> 00:26:54,040
none of my business.

666
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:58,400
Miss,

667
00:26:58,600 --> 00:26:59,360
are we still giving him the painting?

668
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,800
Of course not.

669
00:27:01,560 --> 00:27:02,880
I'm not going to beg her.

670
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:05,440
Besides,

671
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,000
a good painting like this

672
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,520
is better off with me.

673
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:11,160
Be careful, miss.

674
00:27:11,160 --> 00:27:12,680
Your arm is still hurt.

675
00:27:15,040 --> 00:27:15,600
Oh, right.

676
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:17,360
Go get that outfit

677
00:27:17,360 --> 00:27:18,360
I was wearing.

678
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:38,280
What are you looking for?

679
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:44,600
The notes

680
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:46,280
I wrote in that book

681
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:47,280
I borrowed from Mr. Chen.

682
00:27:47,560 --> 00:27:48,920
I took them out

683
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:50,560
and hid them in my sleeve.

684
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:52,440
Then Ye Xian hit me

685
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,600
with his whip.

686
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,760
And now

687
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,040
they're gone.

688
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:17,360
[That feeling of being a guest in your own home.]

689
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:19,160
[I know it well.]

690
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:21,400
[Whenever it gets me down,

691
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:22,840
I cheer myself up.]

692
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,920
[Being a guest in your own home isn't all bad.]

693
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,840
[Since I'm the guest,

694
00:28:28,320 --> 00:28:30,120
if anyone asks to borrow money,

695
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,720
absolutely not.]

696
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:33,880
[The most important thing

697
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:35,120
in life

698
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:37,480
is learning to comfort yourself.]

699
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,360
[Every night, tell yourself:

700
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,440
blame yourself less,

701
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:44,400
find others' faults more.]

702
00:28:45,320 --> 00:28:46,480
[If that doesn't work,

703
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:48,440
go to Linxia,

704
00:28:48,840 --> 00:28:49,760
order a feast,

705
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,560
and eat.]

706
00:28:54,840 --> 00:28:55,800
[Still unhappy?]

707
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:57,320
[Eat again.]

708
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:59,560
[Until you're stuffed

709
00:29:00,360 --> 00:29:01,560
and can't think straight.]

710
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:45,200
In fact,

711
00:29:45,680 --> 00:29:47,400
people your age

712
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:49,120
are either working the fields,

713
00:29:49,280 --> 00:29:50,280
studying by candlelight,

714
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:51,840
or fighting at the front.

715
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,280
Working their fingers to the bone

716
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:54,120
to feed their families.

717
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:55,880
But you?

718
00:29:56,080 --> 00:29:57,240
You eat, drink, and entertain yourself all day.

719
00:29:57,560 --> 00:29:58,440
Lazy and wandering.

720
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,520
Living off your ancestors' glory.

721
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:01,400
Producing nothing.

722
00:30:01,560 --> 00:30:03,440
You contribute nothing to the country or its people.

723
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:17,760
My lord,

724
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,920
we should be going.

725
00:30:35,120 --> 00:30:36,040
Let him go.

726
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,080
He's just a madman.

727
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:40,240
It's not worth going against him.

728
00:30:53,360 --> 00:30:53,920
My lord,

729
00:30:54,280 --> 00:30:55,040
the next guests

730
00:30:55,040 --> 00:30:56,000
will be here any moment.

731
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:56,960
Linxia has already been booked

732
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,400
by someone else.

733
00:30:58,800 --> 00:30:59,720
Why don't you ask the young lord

734
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:01,080
to clear the place?

735
00:31:01,200 --> 00:31:02,800
Who told you to ask me to clear out?

736
00:31:03,560 --> 00:31:04,120
My lord.

737
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:06,240
My lord.

738
00:31:06,600 --> 00:31:07,480
Yes, you.

739
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,720
You want me to move?

740
00:31:09,840 --> 00:31:10,360
Get lost.

741
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:11,160
But.

742
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:15,560
Ms. Chen.

743
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:16,720
My respects to you.

744
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:22,520
Young lord.

745
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:25,320
So you're the one who wants me to move?

746
00:31:27,280 --> 00:31:28,920
Where?

747
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:32,280
You think I don't want to?

748
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:34,320
You think

749
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:36,160
I enjoy eating, drinking,

750
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,440
and lazing around all day?

751
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:40,000
Do you think

752
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,040
you know me so well?

753
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,360
Gu Jinzhao,

754
00:31:54,200 --> 00:31:55,200
you don't know a damn thing.

755
00:31:55,320 --> 00:31:55,640
My lord,

756
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:56,600
let's go back.

757
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:57,360
Get out of my way.

758
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,600
You don't understand anything.

759
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:16,720
Teacher.

760
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:24,320
How's your injury?

761
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,320
I didn't mean to hurt you.

762
00:32:31,560 --> 00:32:32,320
Let me see.

763
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:37,240
Who is that man?

764
00:32:37,840 --> 00:32:39,480
Ye Xian, heir to Marquis Changxing.

765
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:40,320
Does it still hurt?

766
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,320
Isn't that the one with the heart condition

767
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:46,120
who can't join the army?

768
00:32:46,600 --> 00:32:48,240
Can't ride a horse,

769
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:49,000
can't fight.

770
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:51,000
If he never earns any merit,

771
00:32:51,400 --> 00:32:53,480
he might not get the title.

772
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,800
Then the Changxing line

773
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:57,160
would die out.

774
00:32:58,320 --> 00:32:58,920
Why doesn't he

775
00:32:58,920 --> 00:33:00,000
just have more sons then?

776
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,560
You think he hasn't tried?

777
00:33:01,800 --> 00:33:03,080
It's not that he won't,

778
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:05,360
it's that he can't.

779
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,800
How dare you!

780
00:33:14,120 --> 00:33:14,920
Take them back.

781
00:33:15,040 --> 00:33:15,560
Yes, sir.

782
00:33:16,360 --> 00:33:16,800
My lord.

783
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,160
Let's go.

784
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:23,800
Come on, my lord.

785
00:33:24,080 --> 00:33:24,720
Please.

786
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,040
Let's go home.

787
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:27,720
Teacher.

788
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:28,800
This way.

789
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:37,920
Jiuheng,

790
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:40,000
since you manage the Eastern Palace,

791
00:33:40,560 --> 00:33:41,960
tell me,

792
00:33:42,440 --> 00:33:44,480
what do you really think of Ye Xian?

793
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:45,760
I hear

794
00:33:46,080 --> 00:33:48,360
he gets along quite well with His Highness.

795
00:33:53,280 --> 00:33:54,560
I was about to say, teacher.

796
00:33:55,760 --> 00:33:56,880
In my view,

797
00:33:57,560 --> 00:33:58,720
Ye Xian shouldn't

798
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:01,160
stay close to His Highness.

799
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:06,640
Come on, eat.

800
00:34:22,320 --> 00:34:24,120
This classmate of mine grew up poor.

801
00:34:24,679 --> 00:34:25,960
After the new year,

802
00:34:26,199 --> 00:34:27,560
his sister is getting married to some local rich man.

803
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:28,800
He's worried her dowry

804
00:34:28,800 --> 00:34:29,679
will be too shabby

805
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:30,679
and she'll be looked down on.

806
00:34:31,080 --> 00:34:32,040
So he came to us for a loan.

807
00:34:32,520 --> 00:34:33,280
Mother never likes

808
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,520
getting involved in such things.

809
00:34:34,639 --> 00:34:35,639
And Father is even worse.

810
00:34:36,520 --> 00:34:37,679
I don't have any money myself.

811
00:34:38,120 --> 00:34:38,880
So

812
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:40,120
I had to come to you.

813
00:34:40,719 --> 00:34:41,800
How much do you need?

814
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:42,960
Two hundred taels.

815
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:44,320
That much?

816
00:34:45,800 --> 00:34:47,239
That's not a small sum.

817
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:49,120
Give me a few days.

818
00:34:49,120 --> 00:34:50,280
Let me see what I can scrape together.

819
00:34:50,600 --> 00:34:51,080
All right?

820
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:53,840
I.

821
00:35:00,200 --> 00:35:00,760
Well.

822
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:02,440
Alright then.

823
00:35:03,240 --> 00:35:04,080
I'll be going now.

824
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:18,320
Miss,

825
00:35:19,200 --> 00:35:20,880
Yunting from Mr. Chen's side is here.

826
00:35:21,200 --> 00:35:22,280
He said

827
00:35:22,280 --> 00:35:23,520
the seventeenth is Mr. Chen's birthday,

828
00:35:23,640 --> 00:35:25,080
and he'd like to invite you.

829
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:27,520
He also wants to know

830
00:35:27,520 --> 00:35:28,200
how your injury is doing.

831
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,040
Really?

832
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:31,080
He actually said

833
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,560
the seventeenth is his birthday?

834
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,600
But that day at the academy,

835
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,040
he was right there,

836
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:42,480
yet he sent someone else to see me.

837
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:44,160
Now he's inviting me himself.

838
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:46,360
I don't know what to make of it.

839
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:48,920
Maybe last time,

840
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,480
he couldn't come out

841
00:35:50,840 --> 00:35:52,200
to see you alone

842
00:35:52,200 --> 00:35:53,320
because your brother was around.

843
00:35:54,240 --> 00:35:55,200
I think so too.

844
00:35:56,160 --> 00:35:57,880
Then have Yunting ask him.

845
00:35:58,120 --> 00:35:59,440
We'll meet

846
00:35:59,720 --> 00:36:00,680
on Yong'an Bridge.

847
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:01,360
okay?

848
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:02,920
I'll go ask him.

849
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:07,320
My lady wants to meet

850
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:08,320
on Yong'an Bridge

851
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:09,440
on the seventeenth.

852
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:12,520
Got it.

853
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:27,000
Young Master Rong is here.

854
00:36:38,240 --> 00:36:39,800
How are you managing this room?

855
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:41,040
Not even a cup of water.

856
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:50,600
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

857
00:36:58,520 --> 00:36:59,640
Idiot! Idiot!

858
00:37:00,040 --> 00:37:01,280
Are you trying to burn me alive?

859
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:02,000
Forgive me, my lord.

860
00:37:13,160 --> 00:37:13,960
Hot?

861
00:37:14,120 --> 00:37:15,480
Then let it cool down.

862
00:37:16,240 --> 00:37:17,200
What's the rush?

863
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:18,560
Who put you in a bad mood?

864
00:37:18,560 --> 00:37:19,720
You come here to take it out on me.

865
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:22,000
Don't ask.

866
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,320
Let me guess.

867
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:27,000
Father's not home.

868
00:37:27,200 --> 00:37:28,320
Mother spoils you too much

869
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,640
to let you suffer.

870
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:32,320
So,

871
00:37:32,600 --> 00:37:33,560
it must be eldest sister?

872
00:37:36,160 --> 00:37:37,080
Bingo.

873
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:38,280
No wonder.

874
00:37:38,440 --> 00:37:39,360
Actually,

875
00:37:39,360 --> 00:37:40,320
no one dares cross her.

876
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:41,760
She doesn't even put Father

877
00:37:41,760 --> 00:37:42,880
in his place.

878
00:37:43,080 --> 00:37:44,400
You'd better stop provoking her.

879
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:47,440
Why should I?

880
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:49,040
She's the eldest miss, sure,

881
00:37:49,040 --> 00:37:50,280
but I'm the eldest young master of the Gu family.

882
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:53,120
What happened?

883
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:54,760
Tell me.

884
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,720
Why bring up something so shameful?

885
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:00,440
Miss! Miss!

886
00:38:03,680 --> 00:38:04,840
Young Master Rong.

887
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,520
What...

888
00:38:08,240 --> 00:38:09,360
Where have you been all morning?

889
00:38:09,640 --> 00:38:10,560
Not a proper person

890
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:11,200
in the room.

891
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:12,680
And because of that,

892
00:38:12,680 --> 00:38:13,560
our young master burned his mouth on tea.

893
00:38:13,640 --> 00:38:14,880
Now he's throwing a tantrum at me.

894
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:16,200
Miss.

895
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:22,200
What's going on?

896
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:23,480
Why so secretive?

897
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:32,280
Did you hear clearly?

898
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,680
Every word.

899
00:38:38,480 --> 00:38:39,640
I just heard something

900
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:41,120
about eldest sister.

901
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:43,040
I'm not interested in her business.

902
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:45,000
Not interested at all?

903
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:46,640
This person

904
00:38:46,640 --> 00:38:47,360
might just become

905
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,520
our brother-in-law someday.

906
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:50,160
What?

907
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:52,240
Brother-in-law?

908
00:38:53,400 --> 00:38:53,960
Who?

909
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:57,080
Chen Xuanqing.

910
00:39:04,200 --> 00:39:05,200
On Yong'an Bridge.

911
00:39:07,520 --> 00:39:09,240
That new bridge

912
00:39:09,840 --> 00:39:11,040
I haven't seen it yet.

913
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:12,480
Great.

914
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:13,400
Alright then.

915
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:14,560
I'll go give Miss Qingpu an answer

916
00:39:14,560 --> 00:39:15,560
in a bit.

917
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:17,000
Miss Qingpu said

918
00:39:17,200 --> 00:39:18,240
Miss Gu is already thinking about

919
00:39:18,240 --> 00:39:19,680
what birthday gift to get you.

920
00:39:20,760 --> 00:39:21,520
You told her

921
00:39:21,520 --> 00:39:22,360
my birthday?

922
00:39:22,600 --> 00:39:23,080
Yes.

923
00:39:23,440 --> 00:39:25,200
You're meeting Miss Gu on the seventeenth.

924
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,880
Isn't that because

925
00:39:27,200 --> 00:39:28,120
you want to spend your birthday with her?

926
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:28,920
I picked the seventeenth

927
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:30,400
because the academy is closed that day.

928
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:31,080
You.

929
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:33,160
Anyway,

930
00:39:33,360 --> 00:39:34,800
it's already said.

931
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,320
I think

932
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:37,640
Miss Gu is quite nice.

933
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:38,680
Pretty,

934
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:39,760
wealthy,

935
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:41,400
and generous.

936
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,480
Way better

937
00:39:43,600 --> 00:39:44,680
than those noble ladies.

938
00:39:46,240 --> 00:39:46,800
Enough.

939
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:48,760
That's a young lady.

940
00:39:49,240 --> 00:39:50,360
Don't gossip about her like that behind her back.

941
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:52,120
I'll head back now.

942
00:39:52,120 --> 00:39:52,640
Wait.

943
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:53,400
Wait,

944
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:54,560
you forgot.

945
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:55,640
Today the old lady

946
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:56,840
asked you to come home.

947
00:39:58,800 --> 00:39:59,160
Right.

948
00:39:59,640 --> 00:40:00,040
I forgot.

949
00:40:00,240 --> 00:40:00,600
Let's go.

950
00:40:05,200 --> 00:40:07,120
Ever since you became a Top Scholar,

951
00:40:07,600 --> 00:40:09,080
people have been lining up

952
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:10,560
to propose.

953
00:40:11,040 --> 00:40:12,280
I know

954
00:40:12,640 --> 00:40:13,760
many well-bred young ladies

955
00:40:14,040 --> 00:40:16,200
in the capital

956
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:18,920
have their eye on you.

957
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:20,840
Grandmother.

958
00:40:21,880 --> 00:40:22,680
I.

959
00:40:22,680 --> 00:40:24,280
Never mind.

960
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:26,080
What do you think of

961
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:29,000
Yu Wanxue?

962
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:32,760
The Yu family may not be as high ranked as ours,

963
00:40:33,480 --> 00:40:35,720
but they've been scholars for generations.

964
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:38,360
Your uncle Yu

965
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:40,520
is a man of pure character.

966
00:40:41,600 --> 00:40:42,960
He and your third uncle

967
00:40:43,160 --> 00:40:45,240
have been close friends for years.

968
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:47,440
We know each other well.

969
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:48,880
And

970
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,600
Wanxue

971
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:53,680
is a rare, fine young lady.

972
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:55,520
What do you say?

973
00:40:57,080 --> 00:40:58,200
Well,

974
00:40:58,520 --> 00:40:59,800
what does third uncle think?

975
00:41:00,360 --> 00:41:02,520
He's the one who picked her.

976
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:05,080
And I agree.

977
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,800
It does seem like a good match.

978
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:10,320
As for the Yu family,

979
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:12,400
they want to wait until after the new year

980
00:41:12,600 --> 00:41:14,200
to exchange the birth certificates.

981
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:15,880
But of course,

982
00:41:17,640 --> 00:41:20,320
you have to have your say.

983
00:41:20,680 --> 00:41:22,920
It's your marriage.

984
00:41:34,920 --> 00:41:35,480
My lord,

985
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:36,840
you're finally awake.

986
00:41:39,640 --> 00:41:40,800
What time is it?

987
00:41:40,960 --> 00:41:41,880
Just past nine in the morning.

988
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,440
You drank too much yesterday.

989
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:43,960
You slept

990
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:45,120
a full fourteen hours.

991
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:52,400
What about Gu Jinzhao?

992
00:41:53,680 --> 00:41:54,400
Greetings, my lady.

993
00:41:54,680 --> 00:41:55,440
Xian,

994
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:57,280
you just woke up?

995
00:41:59,200 --> 00:41:59,920
Someone come.

996
00:42:00,200 --> 00:42:01,640
Help him wash up.

997
00:42:01,880 --> 00:42:03,560
And pack a few changes of clothes.

998
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:04,360
Yes.

999
00:42:05,040 --> 00:42:05,520
Xian,

1000
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:06,360
I've already sent word

1001
00:42:06,360 --> 00:42:07,440
to your sister.

1002
00:42:07,760 --> 00:42:08,720
You'll go over there in a bit

1003
00:42:09,040 --> 00:42:10,400
and stay at Daxin for a few days.

1004
00:42:12,560 --> 00:42:13,480
What happened?

1005
00:42:13,760 --> 00:42:15,240
Your father just returned from court.

1006
00:42:15,480 --> 00:42:16,080
His Majesty dismissed you

1007
00:42:16,080 --> 00:42:17,720
from your post as the Crown Prince's companion.

1008
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:18,400
What?

1009
00:42:18,400 --> 00:42:18,840
This.

1010
00:42:20,040 --> 00:42:21,000
Did you ask Father

1011
00:42:21,000 --> 00:42:22,120
to beg His Majesty?

1012
00:42:22,320 --> 00:42:24,080
No, of course not.

1013
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:26,080
I did think about it before,

1014
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:27,440
but you didn't want it.

1015
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:28,880
Your father also said

1016
00:42:29,120 --> 00:42:30,080
it was a good path.

1017
00:42:30,080 --> 00:42:31,200
So

1018
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:32,560
I dropped it.

1019
00:42:33,160 --> 00:42:34,040
But

1020
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:35,040
who would have guessed that

1021
00:42:35,040 --> 00:42:36,400
today His Majesty suddenly told your father that

1022
00:42:36,720 --> 00:42:38,120
since you have a heart condition,

1023
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:39,800
you should stay home and rest.

1024
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:41,280
He also said some other things.

1025
00:42:42,400 --> 00:42:43,040
Anyway,

1026
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:45,320
right in front of all the civil and military officials,

1027
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:46,800
he embarrassed your father badly.

1028
00:42:47,080 --> 00:42:47,960
Luckily,

1029
00:42:48,160 --> 00:42:49,400
the Earl of Yongchang came to discuss something with him.

1030
00:42:49,520 --> 00:42:50,240
You need to leave

1031
00:42:50,560 --> 00:42:51,680
before he comes to his senses

1032
00:42:51,880 --> 00:42:52,920
and starts yelling at you again.

1033
00:43:07,680 --> 00:43:08,360
My lord.

1034
00:43:09,240 --> 00:43:09,760
Chen Yi.

1035
00:43:13,640 --> 00:43:14,560
Young lord.

